			"widgets_values":[
				"Episode 1: High-Energy Opening Recap (0–15s)\n\n0–5s: Identity Reveal (Setup for Contrast)\n\nVisuals:\n\n(Quick cut) A pair of rough hands washing dishes in icy water.\n\n(Quick cut) Ella kneels on the floor polishing men’s leather shoes; the camera pans over her humble, downcast face as she is scolded.\n\n(Close-up) Ella lifts her head with cold eyes. The frame instantly switches to negative / black-and-white, with golden bold text effects appearing beside her:\n\nHidden Identity: Only Daughter of the World’s Richest Family\n\nLine (Ella’s inner monologue / reverberation):\n\nNo one knows that this maid I’ve been in the Carter family for five years is actually the sole heir to the trillion-dollar Ellison Consortium.\n\n6–10s: Motive & Expectation (False Warmth)\n\nVisuals:\n\nWarm color tone returns. Ella looks at the cheap but carefully made “Happy 5th Anniversary” small cake on the table, a sweet yet relieved smile tugging at her lips.\n\nThe wall clock ticks, the minute hand approaching 12.\n\nLine (Ella’s inner monologue):\n\nTo repay the kindness from years ago, I hid my identity and endured all kinds of humiliation. Tonight my term ends, and I can finally reveal my true self and tell Ethan the truth…\n\n11–15s: Reality Shatters (Conflict Erupts)\n\nVisuals:\n\nThe villa door is suddenly kicked open (slow motion).\n\nEthan walks in laughing, arm in arm with the glamorous Sophia. Their intimate silhouette is cast directly over Ella’s hopeful face.\n\nThe lighter in Ella’s hand clicks, and the flame dies out.\n\nLine (Ella’s inner monologue → transition sound):\n\nBut what I waited for was not a proposal…\n\n(Sound effects: glass shattering + tinnitus)\n\n…but him with another woman.\n\n【Directly leads to main story: Ella walks over with the cake, only to witness the scene…】\n",
